# Guestbook intake. With these UNSET the guestbook works exactly as it always has — a private,
# per-device wall backed by localStorage. That is a working feature, not a degraded one, so the
# site must never show an error just because no backend is configured.
#
# Both values below are PUBLIC: they ship in the JS bundle by design. The matching secrets — the
# Turnstile secret key and the GitHub token — live only in Cloudflare Worker secrets. See
# worker/README.md.
VITE_GUESTBOOK_ENDPOINT=
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
